    <string name="sources">Sources &amp; credits</string>
    <string name="sources_body">Arabic and English hadith text: sunnah.com (Riyad as-Salihin, Darussalam numbering), distributed through the open “HadithsJSONFormat” dataset. Amharic translation: prepared for this app. Hadith text is a sacred text — always confirm with qualified scholars.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Please note</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">The Amharic translation is a work in progress and is not a substitute for the original Arabic. Report corrections through the project repository so the community can review them.</string>
    <string name="contribute_title">Help complete the translation</string>
    <string name="contribute_body">Translations live in content/am/hadiths.json in the project. Every entry is keyed by the hadith number, so new translations can be added and validated without touching the app code.</string>

